cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this benchmark, please cite it using the following metadata.
title: 'Efflora HarmonyOS Migration Bench: Benchmarking Coding Agents on Migrating Mobile Apps to HarmonyOS'
authors:
  - name: Efflora
type: software
repository-code: 'https://github.com/Equality-Machine/efflora-harmonyos-migration-bench'
abstract: >-
  An open-source benchmark for evaluating AI coding agents on migrating
  real-world iOS and Android apps to HarmonyOS. Tasks are built from real
  open-source mobile apps pinned to specific commits and are verified by
  building the migrated HarmonyOS app and running hidden emulator UI tests
  derived from the source app's behavior. All tasks use the Harbor task
  format.
keywords:
  - harmonyos
  - arkts
  - arkui
  - migration
  - ios
  - android
  - benchmark
  - coding-agent
  - llm-evaluation
license: Apache-2.0
